      "author": null,
      "contributor": null,
      "rationale": "Confirmed bookings whose date has passed count as eligible even if the customer never attended. False-denial is worse than false-award. Fake-booking-for-reviews is economically irrational at current scale. Badge says 'Verified booking' not 'attendance'."
